Hi {Owner},

I build websites for music teachers and music schools around {City}. {Business Name} has lovely student performances on its social pages, but no site where a parent can see teachers, rates and open lesson times.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: an instrument chooser, teachers by style and genre, a recitals page, audition prep and a first-lesson booking, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and teacher or rate changes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone before your afternoon students?

